    - target: {fileID: 1305871861678413093, guid: 1ff9f04734b666b439c06aa7da9a5302, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Day 9\n\nThey\u2019ve established a church to worship their deity,
        holding rituals with accompanying sacrifices, prayers and attempts at communion.
        But this \u201CDeity\u201D has never responded, never granted them anything,
        only robbed them of their sanity and hope. But they persist, maybe because
        they are as hopeless for escape as me, or maybe I just can\u2019t even begin
        to understand them anymore.  \r\nOur boat crashed, the captain could barely
        think straight enough to steer properly anymore, and this little shack feels
        like my only solace. \r\nThis world, it\u2019s infinite repeating seascapes,
        have only...................................\n\n \r\nTHE NON BELIEVERS DOUBT,
        THIS BEAUTIFUL WORLD DESTROYS THEIR MIND.\r\nA TEST FROM OUR LORD, TO SPITE
        THOSE WHO MAY DOUBT.\r\nWE WILL CARRY HIS WILL, ELIMINATE ALL WHO OPPOSE
        HIM.\r\n "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1305871861678413093, guid: 1ff9f04734b666b439c06aa7da9a5302, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1305871861678413093, guid: 1ff9f04734b666b439c06aa7da9a5302, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSizeBase
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5635357165541866718, guid: 1ff9f04734b666b439c06aa7da9a5302, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
